  <name>HashChat</name>
  <summary>Maximum anonymity messenger — Tor-only, Double Ratchet, strong OPSEC</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      HashChat is a privacy-first, metadata-resistant messenger designed for people who need
      serious protection against advanced adversaries.
    </p>
    <p>
      It uses real Double Ratchet cryptography with forward secrecy, Tor v3 hidden services by
      default, burner profiles with aggressive isolation, and an extremely fast panic wipe that
      destroys all cryptographic material.
    </p>
    <p>
      The project follows a maximum paranoid philosophy: minimal attack surface, reproducible
      builds, and honest documentation of limitations.
    </p>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">org.hashchat.HashChat.desktop</launchable>

